{"id":"krepost_","lemma":"крепость","pos":"noun","rank":3204,"glosses":["strength, stoutness","firmness, body, hardness","hardiness, fastness, tenacity"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/98/Ru-%D0%BA%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D0%BA%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"крепости","plural":"крепости"},"examples":[{"text":"Мой дом - моя крепость.","en":"My home is my castle.","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"house, building"},{"g":"my","l":"мой"},null]},{"text":"Крепость была в руках врага.","en":"The fortress was in the enemy's hands.","words":[null,{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"in"},null,{"g":"enemy, foe","l":"враг"}]},{"text":"Он приказал им вернуться в крепость.","en":"He ordered them back to the fort.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"(to) them","l":"он"},{"g":"to return"},{"g":"in"},null]},{"text":"Том с друзьями построили снежную крепость.","en":"Tom and his friends built a snow fort.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"with / from"},{"g":"close friend","l":"друг"},{"g":"to build","l":"построить"},null,null]},{"text":"Солдат расквартировали в старом доме недалеко от крепости.","en":"The soldiers were quartered in an old house near the fort.","words":[{"g":"soldier"},null,{"g":"in"},null,{"g":"house, building","l":"дом"},{"g":"not far"},{"g":"from"},null]}]}